WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:07.140
It's important for us to be realists and not
idealists, we have to be cautiously optimistic

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:14.839
and pragmatic, not delusional, utopian, and
in that vein, it's important that we all understand

00:00:14.839 --> 00:00:20.440
as we think about the next months and certainly
the next couple of years, that there is simply

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:25.680
not going to be the unity that Joe Biden campaigned
on and called for in his inauguration speech.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.920
We've talked about this a little bit more.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:31.810
And later today, we're going to be looking
at one piece of why, which is that thanks

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:38.130
to the cult of Trump, there are now people
in positions of power, like Lauren Bobber,

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:43.500
like Madison Cawthorn, like Marjorie Taylor
Green, who don't know anything.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.399
They are simply political characters playing
roles.

00:00:47.399 --> 00:00:49.380
They are not lawmakers.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.700
They are not thinkers.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:55.050
And unity isn't part of the character they've
been hired to play.

00:00:55.050 --> 00:01:01.829
And by hired, I mean voted in by wacky Trump
Republicans in November of twenty twenty.

00:01:01.829 --> 00:01:03.140
That's one side.

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:08.460
But there is another side to this, which is
that Joe Biden is going to do things that

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:15.580
will disgust not half of the country, but
a large enough portion of it that a contingent

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:21.830
of Republican elected officials will stand
in the way and say no, no matter what.

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:28.890
We actually are seeing amazingly significant
approval of, for example, Joe Biden's first

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:31.490
week, five days uncovered.

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:33.060
And we'll talk about that a little bit later.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:37.580
But even significant approval, like 70 percent,
which in this country is in credit.

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:40.689
It's almost unanimous approval for the standards
we have here.

00:01:40.689 --> 00:01:47.430
The 30 percent that hates it are represented
by some of the most radical members of Congress.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:50.659
And so there is not going to be unity.

00:01:50.659 --> 00:01:57.119
Conservative Rich Lowry wrote a piece in Politico
called No, There Won't Be Unity, and his sub

00:01:57.119 --> 00:02:02.939
headline explains his take on why, which is,
quote, On substance, Biden is not going to

00:02:02.939 --> 00:02:08.019
pursue a consensus, bipartisan, bipartisan
agenda, but a progressive one.

00:02:08.019 --> 00:02:11.590
I don't know that I'd characterize Biden's
agenda as progressive.

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:14.830
It's certainly to the left of recent Democratic
presidents.

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:20.340
But what Rich Lowry is saying is that Joe
Biden is going to do things that the right

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:21.880
will never accept.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:28.750
Joe Biden wants unity around us, deciding
as a country to follow science instead of

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:34.640
cartoonish denialism on covid 30 or so percent
of the country doesn't want that.

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:38.600
This isn't a both sides thing, merely differences
of opinion.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:43.480
Imagine if 30 percent of the country said
we don't agree with the laws of gravity.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:48.069
You'd say, OK, well, you're going to end up
getting a lot of bumps on the head and people

00:02:48.069 --> 00:02:49.599
falling out of buildings.

00:02:49.599 --> 00:02:56.080
But the idea of ignoring something that simply
is you don't really have a choice.

00:02:56.080 --> 00:03:02.300
And Joe Biden is going with reality on covid
and about 30 percent of the country doesn't

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.300
accept it.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:04.510
So you're not going to get unity.

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:11.880
Joe Biden is doing things that are going to
be characterized as stirring the pot, literally

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:16.050
the term Rich Lowry uses in the Politico piece.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:22.019
Last week, I played a clip for you from Fox
News of anchor Ainslee Arehart saying Joe

00:03:22.019 --> 00:03:27.820
Biden called for unity and yet he did executive
orders that go against how Trump governed.

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:32.140
Well, that's a framework where unity is quite
literally impossible.

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:34.659
Now, unity doesn't have to be.

00:03:34.659 --> 00:03:37.230
We agree with Joe Biden on everything.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:39.360
Unity should be Biden one.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.870
Yes, he really did win up.

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.440
Many of them don't accept that.

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:48.260
But OK, but Biden, one unity can be since
Biden won.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.530
Let's try it.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:54.000
Let's not actively obstruct everything Joe
Biden tries to do and let's evaluate where

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.310
we are in six months empirically.

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:57.489
But they're not going to do that.

00:03:57.489 --> 00:04:02.340
And so what Republicans are already saying,
there won't be unity because Joe Biden is

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:03.940
doing stuff.

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:08.239
They are right about half of it, which is
there won't be unity, but it's more because

00:04:08.239 --> 00:04:13.680
of the country being divided culturally to
such a degree.

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:20.079
One side wants to get actual experts and scientists
involved in solving some of the biggest challenges

00:04:20.079 --> 00:04:21.160
we have.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:26.210
The other side wants cartoon character, right
wingers who want to bring guns on the House

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:32.430
floor and feed every false conspiratorial
notion they can come up with.

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:37.210
Unity truly isn't possible in that scenario,
but it isn't because Joe Biden is doing things

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.729
Biden's president.

00:04:38.729 --> 00:04:42.389
That's what presidents do when they get to
work, when they don't go golfing.

00:04:42.389 --> 00:04:46.650
Twenty percent of the time they get to work
and they try to do the things they campaigned

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:47.650
on.

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:52.169
But that's not the story being told on right
wing media, which is another reason why there

00:04:52.169 --> 00:04:53.400
won't be unity.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:56.870
I'm not challenging FOX News is right to exist.

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:58.779
I'm not saying Newsmax should be.

00:04:58.779 --> 00:05:05.340
Hold off the air, I'm pointing out that they
foment the lack of unity by putting out nonsense

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:10.430
like Biden, doing the things he promised to
do is divisive.

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:16.469
Joe Biden doing the things he ran on doing,
which got him elected, is now being called

00:05:16.469 --> 00:05:18.169
a divisive action.

00:05:18.169 --> 00:05:22.119
And understand that with that is your starting
point.

00:05:22.119 --> 00:05:28.229
The possibility of unity doesn't exist because
you're not dealing in actually evaluating

00:05:28.229 --> 00:05:29.330
policy.

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:32.020
You're not dealing and saying, oh, Joe Biden
did this.

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:33.649
Let's see what the results are.

00:05:33.649 --> 00:05:37.770
You're engaging in hyperbole and non-thinking
reactivity.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.229
And so Rich Lowry is right.

00:05:39.229 --> 00:05:43.699
There's not going to be unity, but not because
Joe Biden is some extreme progressive left

00:05:43.699 --> 00:05:44.710
winger.

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:50.499
It's because 30 percent of this country simply
refuses to accept reality and they have enough

00:05:50.499 --> 00:05:55.839
support among the House and Senate that there
will be actual elected official Republicans

00:05:55.839 --> 00:05:59.349
who will do what they can to get in the way
of anything Joe Biden wants to do.

00:05:59.349 --> 00:06:05.119
And anything Joe Biden gets done, they will
say it's bad apriori and Joe Biden should

00:06:05.119 --> 00:06:09.129
be punished because he's doing something different
than what Republicans want him to do.

00:06:09.129 --> 00:06:10.439
It's looking very ugly.

00:06:10.439 --> 00:06:16.789
The good news is it seems that Democrats understand
this and Bernie Sanders understands this and

00:06:16.789 --> 00:06:21.081
they are ready to simply pass things by simple
majority ignoring Republicans.

00:06:21.081 --> 00:06:21.099
Let's talk about that next.

